; todo-v02-flip.sabra — the v0.2 write half: one prelude call.
;
; The 12.5 transition hand-rolled open<->done with rec-val/rec-upd on
; numeric keys; v0.2 ships it as todo-flip.  Read (tree/get), flip,
; write back (tree/put): the two boundary effects stay journaled, the
; invariant (state is only todo-open|todo-done) is recomputed by
; replay.

(lambda (item-path)
  (let ((rec (prim "tree/get" item-path)))
    (prim "tree/put" item-path (todo-flip rec))))
